ing a headset that would make you  perfect so using technology would make  you perfect so I guess in a way it's  quite futuristic but it all goes wrong  in the end I don't want to spoil it for  you if you haven't played it yet the  whole process of making this game has  been crazy it's been a delight it's been  a terror it's been exciting it's been  daunting it's been overwhelming it's  been very insightful and I have learnt a  hell of a lot and working just with  three people making the game it was hard  I'm not gonna say it wasn't hard and I'm  just so proud of us of what we've  managed to make it's not perfect in any  way but a perfection is not a real thing  that's a little point of the game I  carried on fixing the bugs that my  lecturers pointed out after deadline  it's just so you could play it without  any severe bugs and yeah super excited  to see your feedback please do play it  if you play it and you want to put it on  YouTube or anything like that go for it  and do let me know tweet me email me DM  me on the instagrams I want to see  everyone playing this game and what you  think of it because there are a few  different kind of outcomes and there are  some hidden jump scares as well so I  want to see how many people find  everything that can be found I've also  added little Easter eggs so maybe some  of you will find those there's way more  that I want to do to this game and who  knows if I have more time I'll keep on  updating it but also I'm excited to  start getting involved in new projects  new game related products new  interactive projects and it's so easy to  focus on what you didn't get done and  what the game still lacks and the bugs  that are still there and the frame rate  is shoots but  it was three of us making this game in a  matter of under a year in unity trying  to learn everything from concepting  modeling texturing coding optimization  everything we did it we have two games  under our belts we should be proud if  you want to see more a